OL,3,GNEWSA#1m bid to fund new respiratory
OL,4,Aunit for Telford
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #1m appeal to help pay for specialist
OL,7,Fequipment for a new respiratory centre
OL,8,Fin Telford has been launched.
OL,10,FCurrently, some patients with severe
OL,11,Frespiratory conditions receive care
OL,12,Facross different hospital sites or
OL,13,Ftravel outside the area for treatment.
OL,14,FThe Breathing Life campaign would
OL,15,Fsupport a dedicated Respiratory Centre
OL,16,Fat the Princess Royal Hospital.
OL,18,FThe equipment will include machines to
OL,19,Fimprove diagnosis and to help shorten
OL,20,Fhospital stays, Friends of Shrewsbury
OL,21,Fand Telford Hospital said.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
