OL,3,GNEWSA#1m bid to fund new respiratory
OL,4,Aunit for Telford
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Shrewsbury and Telford Hospital
OL,7,FTrust said the centre would bring
OL,8,Fspecialist assessment, diagnosis and
OL,9,Ftreatment under one roof for patients
OL,10,Ffrom Shropshire, Telford and Wrekin,
OL,11,Fand Mid Wales.
